Local modifications (morph, 2026-10-03):
- refractionLens: LiquidGlassSettings.refractionLens (constructor, JSON,
  copyWith, props) selects an outward lens for the lifted lenses of iOS
  27 controls. The geometry pass encodes it as profile 2 (uTextureSize.x)
  with displacement amount * x^1.5 * (1 - 0.54 * smoothstep(0.8, 1, x)),
  x = 1 - depth / min(refractionHeight, halfMinor); the render object
  passes the displacement scale negated, and the final pass decodes with
  its absolute value and multiplies the displacement by its sign, so the
  lens samples outward. Settings comparisons that trigger a geometry
  rebuild include it. Files: lib/src/liquid_glass_settings.dart,
  lib/src/rendering/liquid_glass_render_object.dart,
  lib/src/internal/render_liquid_glass_geometry.dart,
  lib/src/internal/flutter_gpu_geometry_renderer_native.dart,
  lib/src/internal/flutter_gpu_geometry_renderer_web.dart,
  lib/assets/shaders/gpu/geometry_fragment.glsl,
  lib/assets/shaders/liquid_glass_final_render_core.glsl.
